{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/page,_N_T_/blog/led-wall-buyers-checklist"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$c$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1f0m_nyksetzr.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1vd1qadx52uao.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3b8en2pv9-gb8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist | Brightluxx</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-wall-buyers-checklist\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"LED Wall Buyer's Checklist: 12 Questions to Ask Your Supplier\", \"description\": \"The 12 questions that separate serious LED suppliers from traders \\u2014 covering warranty, spares, calibration, compliance and after-sales support in the UAE.\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-wall-buyers-checklist\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/opt_fam_signatouch.webp\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"datePublished\": \"2026-08-19\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-08-19\", \"articleSection\": \"LED Display Technology\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What questions should I ask an LED display supplier?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ask about factory source and reference projects, calibrated brightness, refresh rate, front-serviceability, warranty scope, local spare-parts stock, fault response SLA, on-site calibration, and who handles municipality/DEWA approvals.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What should an LED display warranty in the UAE cover?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A proper warranty covers modules, power supplies and receiving cards for at least 2 years (extendable to 5), with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE and a written response-time SLA.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I know if an LED supplier is a trader or a real integrator?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ask to visit their showroom, see a delivered project at a real address, and meet the installation team. Traders have none of the three; integrators offer all of them the same week.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Blog\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"LED Wall Buyer's Checklist: 12 Questions to Ask Your Supplier\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-wall-buyers-checklist\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>LED Wall Buyer's Checklist: 12 Questions to Ask Your Supplier</h1><p>Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>The 12 questions that separate serious LED suppliers from traders — covering warranty, spares, calibration, compliance and after-sales support in the UAE.</p><div><h2>Why you need a checklist</h2><p>Most LED wall problems are bought, not built: the wrong pitch, a trader with no spares, a warranty that excludes everything. Ask every shortlisted supplier these 12 questions — in writing — and compare answers side by side.</p><h2>Product questions</h2><ol><li><strong>Which factory makes your panels, and can I see a delivered project?</strong> Traders dodge this; manufacturers and factory partners answer instantly with addresses.</li><li><strong>What is the panel's brightness after calibration, not peak?</strong> Calibrated brightness is typically 70–80% of the datasheet number.</li><li><strong>What refresh rate — and is it enough for cameras?</strong> 3840Hz minimum if the screen will ever be filmed.</li><li><strong>Are modules front-serviceable?</strong> Rear-access-only walls cost far more to maintain once installed against a wall.</li><li><strong>What's the pixel pitch for my actual viewing distance?</strong> Check it yourself with a <a href=\"/viewing-distance\">viewing distance calculator</a>.</li></ol><h2>Warranty and after-sales — where UAE buyers get burned</h2><ol start=\"6\"><li><strong>What does your LED display warranty in the UAE actually cover?</strong> It must include modules, power supplies and receiving cards; ask for exclusions in writing.</li><li><strong>Where are spare modules stocked?</strong> \"In China\" means a 4–8 week wait with a hole in your screen. Local UAE stock should be included with the project.</li><li><strong>What's the guaranteed response time for a fault?</strong> Get an SLA in the contract, not a verbal promise.</li><li><strong>Do you calibrate on site after installation?</strong> Batch-matched, camera-calibrated walls look seamless; uncalibrated ones show patchwork tiles within months.</li></ol><h2>Compliance and commercial</h2><ol start=\"10\"><li><strong>Who handles municipality, DED and DEWA approvals?</strong> In Dubai these are mandatory for external signage — see our <a href=\"/dubai\">Dubai regulations overview</a>.</li><li><strong>Is structure, power and content management included or excluded?</strong> The cheapest panel quote is often the most expensive project.</li><li><strong>Can I visit your showroom and see my content on a demo wall?</strong> If there's no showroom, ask why. Ours is in Jebel Ali — <a href=\"/contact\">book a visit</a>.</li></ol><p>Want the full pricing context before you meet suppliers? Read the <a href=\"/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\">UAE LED pricing guide</a> and size your wall with our <a href=\"/tools/led-wall-size-calculator\">wall size calculator</a>.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What questions should I ask an LED display supplier?</h3><p>Ask about factory source and reference projects, calibrated brightness, refresh rate, front-serviceability, warranty scope, local spare-parts stock, fault response SLA, on-site calibration, and who handles municipality/DEWA approvals.</p><h3>What should an LED display warranty in the UAE cover?</h3><p>A proper warranty covers modules, power supplies and receiving cards for at least 2 years (extendable to 5), with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE and a written response-time SLA.</p><h3>How do I know if an LED supplier is a trader or a real integrator?</h3><p>Ask to visit their showroom, see a delivered project at a real address, and meet the installation team. Traders have none of the three; integrators offer all of them the same week.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__ne