luxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n12:Ted4,\\u003ch1\\u003eLED Wall Buyer's Checklist: 12 Questions to Ask Your Supplier\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBlog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe 12 questions that separate serious LED suppliers from traders — covering warranty, spares, calibration, compliance and after-sales support in the UAE.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eWhy you need a checklist\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eMost LED wall problems are bought, not built: the wrong pitch, a trader with no spares, a warranty that excludes everything. Ask every shortlisted supplier these 12 questions — in writing — and compare answers side by side.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eProduct questions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003col\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhich factory makes your panels, and can I see a delivered project?\\u003c/strong\\u003e Traders dodge this; manufacturers and factory partners answer instantly with addresses.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat is the panel's brightness after calibration, not peak?\\u003c/strong\\u003e Calibrated brightness is typically 70–80% of the datasheet number.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat refresh rate — and is it enough for cameras?\\u003c/strong\\u003e 3840Hz minimum if the screen will ever be filmed.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAre modules front-serviceable?\\u003c/strong\\u003e Rear-access-only walls cost far more to maintain once installed against a wall.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat's the pixel pitch for my actual viewing distance?\\u003c/strong\\u003e Check it yourself with a \\u003ca href=\\\"/viewing-distance\\\"\\u003eviewing distance calculator\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ol\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eWarranty and after-sales — where UAE buyers get burned\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003col start=\\\"6\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat does your LED display warranty in the UAE actually cover?\\u003c/strong\\u003e It must include modules, power supplies and receiving cards; ask for exclusions in writing.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhere are spare modules stocked?\\u003c/strong\\u003e \\\"In China\\\" means a 4–8 week wait with a hole in your screen. Local UAE stock should be included with the project.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat's the guaranteed response time for a fault?\\u003c/strong\\u003e Get an SLA in the contract, not a verbal promise.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDo you calibrate on site after installation?\\u003c/strong\\u003e Batch-matched, camera-calibrated walls look seamless; uncalibrated ones show patchwork tiles within months.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ol\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eCompliance and commercial\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003col start=\\\"10\\\"\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWho handles municipality, DED and DEWA approvals?\\u003c/strong\\u003e In Dubai these are mandatory for external signage — see our \\u003ca href=\\\"/dubai\\\"\\u003eDubai regulations overview\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eIs structure, power and content management included or excluded?\\u003c/strong\\u003e The cheapest panel quote is often the most expensive project.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCan I visit your showroom and see my content on a demo wall?\\u003c/strong\\u003e If there's no showroom, ask why. Ours is in Jebel Ali — \\u003ca href=\\\"/contact\\\"\\u003ebook a visit\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ol\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWant the full pricing context before you meet suppliers? Read the \\u003ca href=\\\"/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\\\"\\u003eUAE LED pricing guide\\u003c/a\\u003e and size your wall with our \\u003ca href=\\\"/tools/led-wall-size-calculator\\\"\\u003ewall size calculator\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat questions should I ask an LED display supplier?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAsk about factory source and reference projects, calibrated brightness, refresh rate, front-serviceability, warranty scope, local spare-parts stock, fault response SLA, on-site calibration, and who handles municipality/DEWA approvals.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat should an LED display warranty in the UAE cover?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eA proper warranty covers modules, power supplies and receiving cards for at least 2 years (extendable to 5), with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE and a written response-time SLA.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow do I know if an LED supplier is a trader or a real integrator?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAsk to visit their showroom, see a delivered project at a real address, and meet the installation team. Traders have none of the three; integrators offer all of them the same week.\\u003c/p\\u003e11:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$12\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-wall-buyers-checklist\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n9:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"blog\",\"led-wall-buyers-checklist\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"blog/led-wa