D Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n11:Ted4,<h1>LED Wall Buyer's Checklist: 12 Questions to Ask Your Supplier</h1><p>Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>The 12 questions that separate serious LED suppliers from traders — covering warranty, spares, calibration, compliance and after-sales support in the UAE.</p><div><h2>Why you need a checklist</h2><p>Most LED wall problems are bought, not built: the wrong pitch, a trader with no spares, a warranty that excludes everything. Ask every shortlisted supplier these 12 questions — in writing — and compare answers side by side.</p><h2>Product questions</h2><ol><li><strong>Which factory makes your panels, and can I see a delivered project?</strong> Traders dodge this; manufacturers and factory partners answer instantly with addresses.</li><li><strong>What is the panel's brightness after calibration, not peak?</strong> Calibrated brightness is typically 70–80% of the datasheet number.</li><li><strong>What refresh rate — and is it enough for cameras?</strong> 3840Hz minimum if the screen will ever be filmed.</li><li><strong>Are modules front-serviceable?</strong> Rear-access-only walls cost far more to maintain once installed against a wall.</li><li><strong>What's the pixel pitch for my actual viewing distance?</strong> Check it yourself with a <a href=\"/viewing-distance\">viewing distance calculator</a>.</li></ol><h2>Warranty and after-sales — where UAE buyers get burned</h2><ol start=\"6\"><li><strong>What does your LED display warranty in the UAE actually cover?</strong> It must include modules, power supplies and receiving cards; ask for exclusions in writing.</li><li><strong>Where are spare modules stocked?</strong> \"In China\" means a 4–8 week wait with a hole in your screen. Local UAE stock should be included with the project.</li><li><strong>What's the guaranteed response time for a fault?</strong> Get an SLA in the contract, not a verbal promise.</li><li><strong>Do you calibrate on site after installation?</strong> Batch-matched, camera-calibrated walls look seamless; uncalibrated ones show patchwork tiles within months.</li></ol><h2>Compliance and commercial</h2><ol start=\"10\"><li><strong>Who handles municipality, DED and DEWA approvals?</strong> In Dubai these are mandatory for external signage — see our <a href=\"/dubai\">Dubai regulations overview</a>.</li><li><strong>Is structure, power and content management included or excluded?</strong> The cheapest panel quote is often the most expensive project.</li><li><strong>Can I visit your showroom and see my content on a demo wall?</strong> If there's no showroom, ask why. Ours is in Jebel Ali — <a href=\"/contact\">book a visit</a>.</li></ol><p>Want the full pricing context before you meet suppliers? Read the <a href=\"/blog/led-display-pricing-guide-uae\">UAE LED pricing guide</a> and size your wall with our <a href=\"/tools/led-wall-size-calculator\">wall size calculator</a>.</p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What questions should I ask an LED display supplier?</h3><p>Ask about factory source and reference projects, calibrated brightness, refresh rate, front-serviceability, warranty scope, local spare-parts stock, fault response SLA, on-site calibration, and who handles municipality/DEWA approvals.</p><h3>What should an LED display warranty in the UAE cover?</h3><p>A proper warranty covers modules, power supplies and receiving cards for at least 2 years (extendable to 5), with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE and a written response-time SLA.</p><h3>How do I know if an LED supplier is a trader or a real integrator?</h3><p>Ask to visit their showroom, see a delivered project at a real address, and meet the installation team. Traders have none of the three; integrators offer all of them the same week.</p>4:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\n5:[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$13\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@14\"}]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$13\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Blog — Led Wall Buyers Checklist. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/led-wall-buyers-checklist\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\na:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{}]}]]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"404 — Page Not Found\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The page you requested does not exist.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/products\",\"children\":\"Browse products\"}]}]]}],[]]}]]}]}]]}]\n14:null\n10:true\n7:300\n7:C\nf:0\n9:\"$undefined\"\nb:\"$undefined\"\ne:\"$undefined\"\n6:\"$undefined\"\n"}}